## Scheduled tasks

A task with a schedule label runs at fixed times (cron, UTC):

```python
@broker.task(schedule=[{"cron": "0 3 * * *"}])
async def purge_old_rows() -> None: ...
```

The `scheduler` process (`uv run taskiq scheduler {{ name.package }}.worker.scheduler:scheduler
{{ name.package }}.worker.tasks`) sends it to the broker at those times; the worker runs it.
Run exactly one scheduler.
